            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"># Clearer meeting recaps

- Follow each important topic with its own set of useful key points in Summary.
- Get more detailed decisions, including agreed scope, conditions and rationale.
- Recaps adapt to the depth of the discussion and preserve more context in longer meetings.
- Jump from a topic to its supporting transcript passages.

Regenerate an existing meeting's recap to apply these improvements.
</description>
